# VESPER HALL ROOF -- the observatory terrace
# Tileset: TILESET_MANSION (Celadon Mansion roof blocks). 7x5, buffer 143/1300.
# Stairwell 24 (top-left) comes up from the 2F back stair. The little roof
# house (28/29/26/27) is the Lord's telescope dome; its door stays shut until
# the Shadow Prism is recovered from the Secret Lab, then opens on an
# eclipse-night event (static encounter or the post-game reveal).
# Gap: no telescope tile; the dome is implied by the roof house. No plain
# roof floor either: 2b carries a 1px edge line, so the terrace shows faint
# paving seams every block (vanilla only uses 2b at the roof edge).
ref CeladonMansionRoof
tileset mansion
key A=24 h=28 i=29 j=26 k=27 |=2c .=2b L=1d l=1e c=21 e=2a
grid:
Alllll|
...hi.|
...jk.|
......|
Llllllc
end
exit STAIRS 1 1
exit DOME 8 5
obj npc 10 6 Astronomer down
obj item 2 6 Stardust
